cppgm-extended is an independently maintained adaptation. Its authors have
substantially edited, consolidated, renumbered and extended the original
course into 35 assignments. The compiler implementation, reference tools,
regenerated outputs and current teaching sequence are maintained by this
project. Current PA numbers do not correspond to original CPPGM numbering.

Questions about inherited material should be directed to the repository
maintainers.

The plain-text CWG issue references and WG21 papers under doc/cwg/ retain
their source, contributor, revision and adoption information. They are
attributed to their original WG21 contributors; the project does not claim
authorship of that reference material. See doc/cwg/INDEX.txt and manifest.json.

